Meta.documentation:String.upper
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Upper-cases every String passing through.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator resource: each input String is emitted immediately,
Meta.documentation:upper-cased. Letters without case pass through unchanged.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all — each input String
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — the upper-cased result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:Hello>>String.upper:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:HELLO
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.lower String.trim
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20upper()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22upper%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DupperProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20upperProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20this%3F.out_String_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Ainput.value.toUpperCase()%7D)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Aupper.Processor%3DupperProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dupper%3B]>>NewResource:String.upper
